# T_SCRE: the Loans tab of the item form: item 5 lent once more from its
# tab, and on leaving the tab the form shows the new quantity on loan; a
# loan returned in the tab (empty date: today), the form again up to
# date; item 6's tab with a returned loan, where Return or release shows
# the server's message.
K DOWN DOWN DOWN DOWN ENTER
S ITEM5
K ALT-C A
S TAB5
K INS ENTER
S NEWLOAN
K TAB
T Gina
K TAB TAB TAB
T 2026-10-20
K CTRL-S
S LENT
K ESC
S ONLOAN2
K ALT-C A HOME ALT-C R
S ASKRET
K ENTER
S RETURNED
K ESC
S ONLOAN1
K ESC DOWN ENTER ALT-C A
S TAB6
K HOME ALT-C R ENTER
S ALREADY
K ESC ESC ESC
